       622-UPDATE-DPORECD.
           ACCEPT CUR-DATE-WA FROM DATE.
           IF CUR-DATE-YY > "70"
               MOVE "19" TO CUR-DATE-CC
           ELSE
               MOVE "20" TO CUR-DATE-CC.
           MOVE CUR-DATE-WA           TO  PO-PRFAX-DATE.
           REWRITE DPORECD-REC-O FROM BUF-DPORECD
               INVALID KEY    MOVE FILE-STATUS TO FILE-STATUS.
           IF FILE-STATUS NOT = "00"
               MOVE "UPDATE DPORECD FAILED *622-UD PARA"
                   TO BU-DISPLAY-MSG
               MOVE PO-RCV-NO         TO  BU-DISPLAY-FLD (2)
               GO TO 2-BLOWUP.

